Third-party references
----------------------

roBrowserLegacy (GPL-3.0, https://github.com/MrAntares/roBrowserLegacy) and
Korangar (MIT, https://github.com/vE5li/korangar) are behavioural references
only. No code is copied from either project unless it is listed in this file.

roBrowser effect data
---------------------

`Packages/RagnarokEffects/Sources/RagnarokEffects/EffectTable+Reference.swift`
and the skill-to-effect entries added to `SkillEffectTable.swift` on 2026-11-08
are generated by `scripts/skill-effects/gen-effect-table.py` from the effect id
and asset name tables in roBrowser's `src/DB/Effects/EffectTable.js` and
`src/DB/Skills/SkillEffect.js` (roBrowser by Vincent Thibault, GPL-3.0,
https://github.com/vthibault/roBrowser, commit e4b5b53). Only ids, asset file
names and flags are taken, no code.

Gravity assets
--------------

No Gravity assets are included in this repository. The user supplies their own
kRO client. Do not commit data.grf, rdata.grf, BGM, or extracted Gravity files.
